# Jobtrack UI

Read `design-systems/jobtrack/DESIGN.md` before visual changes.

## Theming

- Semantic colors only: `canvas`, `card`, `input`, `ink`, `surface`, `brand`, `stage-*`
- Dark mode via `html.dark` + CSS variables — never duplicate components for light/dark
- Do not use `bg-white` for themed surfaces; use `bg-card` or `bg-input`
- Light mode appearance must remain unchanged when editing tokens

## Components

- Prefer `jt-btn-*`, `jt-input`, `jt-card`, `jt-page`, `jt-pill` over raw Tailwind
- Stage colors from `src/data/stages.ts`
- Icons from `lucide-react`

## Data access

- Renderer calls `window.tracker.*` only — no direct DB, no HTTP
